# On the real park: the Otis portal quarterpipe and the north rear Hellride quarter stand back to
# back. Up the Otis quarter at 9 m/s, ; in the air: over the spine, down the Hellride side and out
# east on the floor (a clean landing, 6 m/s down from 1.3 m above the lip). Phase 27: the air leaves
# the wall a tick sooner, before the coping pipe on the Otis lip (soma-coping-speed): the transfer comes
# a few ticks later, the landing and the combo a few sooner.
park soma
cmd 0 teleport 82.5 20.2 -1.75 60.8
cmd 30 speed 9
tap revert 115
run 400
expect event spineTransfer within 120..120
expect event land{quality=clean} within 274..274
expect skater.vel.x > 3 at 320
expect event comboLanded{name=Spine Transfer} within 285..285
expect no event bail
